   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Different subjects with damit",
     "texto": [
      "When the person acting isn't the one performing the second action, «damit» must be used: **Ich spreche langsam, damit du mich verstehst** (I speak slowly so that you understand me). In German the indicative is used with the verb at the end; English has no special form here, we simply say \"so that you understand\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "damit versus um … zu",
     "texto": [
      "If the subjects were the same, «um … zu» is preferred (**Ich lerne, um zu bestehen**). But if another person is involved, «damit» is the only option: **Ich helfe dir, damit du die Prüfung bestehst**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
